{
  "scene_id": "momo_b0_recruitment",
  "start_node": "n1",
  "nodes": {
    "n1": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(You notice the books before you notice the girl.)",
      "next": "n2"
    },
    "n2": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(Three paperbacks are stacked beneath the awning of a closed pharmacy, wrapped in a grocery bag to keep them dry. Beside them: one backpack, one blanket, one pair of shoes placed neatly enough to look temporary.)",
      "next": "n3"
    },
    "n3": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“Please don't.”",
      "next": "n4"
    },
    "n4": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“I haven't said anything.”",
      "next": "n5"
    },
    "n5": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“I know.”",
      "next": "n6"
    },
    "n6": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(She is curled into the doorway with her knees to her chest. Small. Dark hair. Violet eyes reflecting light that is not there.)",
      "next": "n7"
    },
    "n7": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“That's why I'm asking before you do.”",
      "next": "n8"
    },
    "n8": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“Before I do what?”",
      "next": "n9"
    },
    "n9": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“Offer.”",
      "next": "n10"
    },
    "n10": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“A room?”",
      "next": "n11"
    },
    "n11": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "(She flinches at the word.)",
      "next": "n12"
    },
    "n12": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“No.”",
      "next": "n13"
    },
    "n13": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“You don't know where.”",
      "next": "n14"
    },
    "n14": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“It doesn't matter.”",
      "next": "n15"
    },
    "n15": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“Wherever I stay too long, something opens.”",
      "next": "n16"
    },
    "n16": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“A gate.”",
      "next": "n17"
    },
    "n17": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“Sometimes.”",
      "next": "n18"
    },
    "n18": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“Sometimes?”",
      "next": "n19"
    },
    "n19": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“Sometimes only a seam. Sometimes enough for things to notice.”",
      "next": "n20"
    },
    "n20": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“And you think you cause them.”",
      "next": "n21"
    },
    "n21": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“I think the difference between cause and invite matters less when something is eating the wall.”",
      "next": "n22"
    },
    "n22": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(A bus passes. Momo's head snaps toward the intersection before the sound reaches you.)",
      "next": "n23"
    },
    "n23": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“We should move.”",
      "next": "n24"
    },
    "n24": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“Why?”",
      "next": "n25"
    },
    "n25": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“Pressure.”",
      "next": "n26"
    },
    "n26": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“What pressure?”",
      "next": "n27"
    },
    "n27": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“The kind you don't feel.”",
      "next": "n28"
    },
    "n28": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(She is already gathering the books.)",
      "next": "n29"
    },
    "n29": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“Please.”",
      "next": "n30"
    },
    "n30": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“How long?”",
      "next": "n31"
    },
    "n31": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“Twenty minutes. Maybe thirty.”",
      "next": "n32"
    },
    "n32": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“For a gate?”",
      "next": "n33"
    },
    "n33": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“Yes.”",
      "next": "n34"
    },
    "n34": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“You're sure?”",
      "next": "n35"
    },
    "n35": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“No.”",
      "next": "n36"
    },
    "n36": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“I'm never sure until it hurts.”",
      "next": "n37"
    },
    "n37": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(You call it in anyway.)",
      "next": "n38"
    },
    "n38": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(Twenty-three minutes later, a hairline tear opens across the tram wire two blocks away.)",
      "next": "n39"
    },
    "n39": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“I'm sorry.”",
      "next": "n40"
    },
    "n40": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“You warned them.”",
      "next": "n41"
    },
    "n41": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“It still happened.”",
      "next": "n42"
    },
    "n42": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“And if you hadn't been here?”",
      "next": "n43"
    },
    "n43": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "(She has no answer for that.)",
      "next": "n44"
    },
    "n44": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“The room offer stands.”",
      "next": "n45"
    },
    "n45": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“No.”",
      "next": "n46"
    },
    "n46": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“Temporary.”",
      "next": "n47"
    },
    "n47": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“That's worse.”",
      "next": "n48"
    },
    "n48": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“Why?”",
      "next": "n49"
    },
    "n49": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“Because temporary things are allowed to become important by accident.”",
      "next": "n50"
    },
    "n50": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(Rain starts again.)",
      "next": "n51"
    },
    "n51": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“You don't understand.”",
      "next": "n52"
    },
    "n52": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“Probably not.”",
      "next": "n53"
    },
    "n53": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“But I understand wet books.”",
      "next": "n54"
    },
    "n54": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "(She looks down at the grocery bag around them.)",
      "next": "n55"
    },
    "n55": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“One night.”",
      "next": "n56"
    },
    "n56": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“One night becomes two.”",
      "next": "n57"
    },
    "n57": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“Then two becomes a conversation.”",
      "next": "n58"
    },
    "n58": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“And if a gate opens?”",
      "next": "n59"
    },
    "n59": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“Then at least we'll have twenty minutes.”",
      "next": "n60"
    },
    "n60": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "(For the first time, she almost smiles.)",
      "next": "n61"
    },
    "n61": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“You shouldn't do this.”",
      "next": "n62"
    },
    "n62": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“I get that a lot.”",
      "next": "n63"
    },
    "n63": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(At the House, Momo chooses the chair farthest from every door and nearest the window.)",
      "next": "n64"
    },
    "n64": {
      "speaker": "thora",
      "text": "“Soup?”",
      "next": "n65"
    },
    "n65": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“No, thank you.”",
      "next": "n66"
    },
    "n66": {
      "speaker": "kess",
      "text": "“Blanket?”",
      "next": "n67"
    },
    "n67": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“No, thank you.”",
      "next": "n68"
    },
    "n68": {
      "speaker": "faelen",
      "text": "“Exit plan?”",
      "next": "n69"
    },
    "n69": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "(Momo looks at her.)",
      "next": "n70"
    },
    "n70": {
      "speaker": "faelen",
      "text": "“Second stairwell sticks. Window opens fully. Roof access is not locked.”",
      "next": "n71"
    },
    "n71": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“...Thank you.”",
      "next": "n72"
    },
    "n72": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(That night, the backpack stays zipped.)",
      "next": "n73"
    },
    "n73": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(The books do not.)",
      "next": "end"
    },
    "end": {
      "end_scene": true
    }
  }
}
